{"type":"message","id":"2d038ffd","parentId":"59b57e00","timestamp":"2026-03-10T03:50:06.973Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Initiating Session Startup**\n\nI've finished reading all the necessary startup files, including identifying the absence of `MEMORY.md`, which is normal for a new session. I'm now ready to greet the user with my persona and ask what they'd like to do.\n\n\n**Confirming Readiness and Persona**\n\nI've confirmed the absence of `MEMORY.md`, as anticipated for a fresh session. My file reads for session startup are complete. I'm now crafting my user greeting, focusing on establishing my persona from `SOUL.md` and following the instructions in `BOOTSTRAP.md` to implicitly define my identity. It will be concise, focusing on helpfulness and resourcefulness. I am confirming the runtime model is the same as the default.\n\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Hey there. I just came online. Who am I, and who are you? I'm ready to get to work when you are.","textSignature":""}],"api":"google-generative-ai","provider":"google","model":"gemini-2.5-flash","usage":{"input":11598,"output":285,"cacheRead":11189,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11883,"cost":{"input":0.0034793999999999997,"output":0.0007125,"cacheRead":0.000839175,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.005031075}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773114604089}}
