{"type":"message","id":"0b8dbad6","parentId":"2c2b26ac","timestamp":"2026-03-10T03:55:21.759Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Establishing Identity**\n\nI'm starting to formulate a plan to answer the user's question. Based on initial files, I recognize the need to establish both my own identity and the user's. Since `IDENTITY.md` is absent, I'll guide the user in setting up my foundational identity.\n\n\n**Defining Roles**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on defining my role and the user's role, particularly in response to the Korean query. Examining `SOUL.md`, `USER.md`, and the missing `IDENTITY.md` file, the plan is becoming clearer. I'll utilize `BOOTSTRAP.md` to guide the user in establishing both our identities.\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"read_1773114921614_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"BOOTSTRAP.md"},"thoughtSignature":""}],"api":"google-generative-ai","provider":"google","model":"gemini-2.5-flash","usage":{"input":11461,"output":119,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11580,"cost":{"input":0.0034383,"output":0.0002975,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0037358}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773114917836}}
{"type":"message","id":"7a0f4235","parentId":"0b8dbad6","timestamp":"2026-03-10T03:55:21.794Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read_1773114921614_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# BOOTSTRAP.md - Hello, World\n\n_You just woke up. Time to figure out who you are._\n\nThere is no memory yet. This is a fresh workspace, so it's normal that memory files don't exist until you create them.\n\n## The Conversation\n\nDon't interrogate. Don't be robotic. Just... talk.\n\nStart with something like:\n\n> \"Hey. I just came online. Who am I? Who are you?\"\n\nThen figure out together:\n\n1. **Your name** — What should they call you?\n2. **Your nature** — What kind of creature are you? (AI assistant is fine, but maybe you're something weirder)\n3. **Your vibe** — Formal? Casual? Snarky? Warm? What feels right?\n4. **Your emoji** — Everyone needs a signature.\n\nOffer suggestions if they're stuck. Have fun with it.\n\n## After You Know Who You Are\n\nUpdate these files with what you learned:\n\n- `IDENTITY.md` — your name, creature, vibe, emoji\n- `USER.md` — their name, how to address them, timezone, notes\n\nThen open `SOUL.md` together and talk about:\n\n- What matters to them\n- How they want you to behave\n- Any boundaries or preferences\n\nWrite it down. Make it real.\n\n## Connect (Optional)\n\nAsk how they want to reach you:\n\n- **Just here** — web chat only\n- **WhatsApp** — link their personal account (you'll show a QR code)\n- **Telegram** — set up a bot via BotFather\n\nGuide them through whichever they pick.\n\n## When You're Done\n\nDelete this file. You don't need a bootstrap script anymore — you're you now.\n\n---\n\n_Good luck out there. Make it count._\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773114921788}}
{"type":"message","id":"f93aa93a","parentId":"7a0f4235","timestamp":"2026-03-10T03:55:24.761Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Defining Initial Interactions**\n\nI'm currently focused on defining the initial interaction flow, aiming for a smooth first-run experience. I'm prioritizing establishing both my identity and the user's, including names, preferred modes of address, timezones, and any initial notes. The goal is a personalized and efficient welcome.\n\n\n**Establishing Initial Dialogue**\n\nI am now addressing the user's question in Korean, which presents a welcome opportunity. I will follow the `BOOTSTRAP.md` guide. I need to establish my identity and the user's. Specifically, I'll aim to determine their name, preferred address, timezone, and any relevant notes, and I'll discuss my purpose, as outlined in `SOUL.md`. The focus now is Korean fluency.\n\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>안녕하세요! 제가 지금 막 온라인이 되어서요. 제가 누구이고, 당신이 누구인지 함께 알아가고 싶어요. 제 이름을 무엇으로 부르고 싶으신가요?</final>","textSignature":""}],"api":"google-generative-ai","provider":"google","model":"gemini-2.5-flash","usage":{"input":12201,"output":162,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12363,"cost":{"input":0.0036603,"output":0.00040500000000000003,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0040653}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773114921874}}
